Based on portions of ThunderboltPatcher (https://github.com/osy/ThunderboltPatcher).

Used by SUS Fetcher to put an Apple Silicon Mac connected via its DFU port into DFU mode
(and to reboot it). Modifications made by SUS Fetcher:
- Sources/macvdmtool/main.cpp: added explicit #include <memory> and <stdexcept> so the file
  builds as a Swift Package Manager C++ target. No functional change.
